<title>UK: London gold fixes easier after option expiry.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes easier after option expiry.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $326.55 vs $327.50 AM. Edged lower in early New York business. OTC option expiry not major price influence. $328-$330 still offering resistance.</p>
<p>SILVER - Down two cents at $4.36/$4.38.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Down $4.50 at $425.00/$429.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Down $4.00 at $200.00/$203.00.</p>
</text>
